meta-yp-distro
==============

Yocto distribution layer for the yp-wrynose distribution (YP-M1 developer
platform). This layer provides the `yp-wrynose` distro configuration,
`meta-yp-distro` images/packagegroups, and build concurrence helpers.

Layer dependencies (see conf/layer.conf):
  - core  (openembedded-core)
  - yocto (meta-poky; registered collection name, ISS-009)

Compatible release series: wrynose (see LAYERSERIES_COMPAT_meta-yp-distro).

Contents
--------
  conf/distro/yp-wrynose.conf   distro definition (DISTRO = "yp-wrynose")
  classes/yp-concurrency.bbclass  CPU/memory-aware concurrency helper
  recipes-core/images/          yp-image-dev / yp-image-prod
  recipes-core/packagegroups/   base / devtools / kernel-tools groups

Maintainer
----------
  zeek.zhao <zeek.zhao@foxmail.com>

Patching / contributions
------------------------
Send patches to the maintainer email above. Patches should be generated with
`git format-patch`, include a signed-off-by line, and target the
`feat-m1-dev-platform` branch. Do not rebase or force-push published tags
(`m0.1.3` and earlier are frozen).

